\\ Round trip: the TC1-C1 hand fixture spawn-into-failed-scope, in surface syntax.
\\ frontend/test.sh compares this program's run (production FIFO schedule) with the run of the fixture's artifact.

(define main {I64 --> I64}
  input -> (scope (let a (spawn (lambda (_ : Unit) (/ 1 0)))
                    (do (await a) (spawn (lambda (_ : Unit) 0)) 0))))
